  "limitation_one_euro_filtering_not_controllable": "One-Euro temporal filtering (webcam) vs. none (Kaggle, static photos) could NOT be controlled for -- raw unfiltered webcam video frames were never saved, only the final filtered feature vectors. Retroactively removing the filter's effect, or fabricating an 'unfiltered webcam' dataset, is not possible without new data collection. This asymmetry is partly inherent to comparing a photo dataset against a video-capture dataset and is reported as an unresolved limitation, not a fixed confound."
